cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Dream-RSI in your research, please cite the original Dream-RSI paper below. GPTDoug ecosystem integration credit is recorded separately."
title: "Dream-RSI: Recursive Self-Improvement through Evolving Worlds"
abstract: >-
  Dream-RSI is a framework for scalable and recursively self-improving exploration.
  A lightweight orchestration layer makes exploration explicit and programmable while
  leaving the underlying coding agent unchanged. Accumulated discovery history serves as
  a replay simulator over the realized search space, providing immediate, low-cost
  off-policy feedback for evaluating and refining exploration policies without repeated
  expensive online evaluations.
type: software
url: "https://www.dream-rsi.com"
repository-code: "https://github.com/zhengkid/Dream-RSI"
date-released: 2026-09-11
keywords:
  - recursive self-improvement
  - exploration policy
  - off-policy evaluation
  - LLM agents
  - code discovery
  - meta-learning
  - gptdougllmdeepmindrsi
  - agent swarm
  - AI governance
  - ontology
